DolibarrMcpServerIntro=Dolibarr MCP Server is a small Node.js server that runs next to Dolibarr. It lets AI assistants such as Claude look up and work with your Dolibarr data through the REST API. Every call uses the connected user's own API key, so Dolibarr permissions apply exactly as in the web interface. Irreversible steps (validating, deleting, payments, stock movements) always need explicit confirmation.
